<title>POLAND: IBCA gives Slaski BBB long-term rating.</title>
<headline>IBCA gives Slaski BBB long-term rating.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The IBCA rating agency gave Poland's Bank Slaski a BBB rating for long-term debt, an A3 rating for short-term debt and an individual rating of C, Slaski said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Bank Slaski officials had no immediate comment on the rating.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
